## Data Flow Summary

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Browser (RacePage)
    participant Store as useRaceStore
    participant LobbyPoll as useLobbyPolling
    participant SyncPoll as useRaceSync
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Redis as Redis

    Note over User: User lands on /race/[roomId]

    User->>API: GET /api/race/[roomId] (rehydrate)
    API-->>User: roomData (state, prompt, players)
    User->>Store: setGameState(WAITING_FOR_GUEST)

    LobbyPoll->>API: GET /api/race/[roomId] (every 2s)
    API-->>LobbyPoll: state: LOBBY_FULL
    LobbyPoll->>Store: setGameState(LOBBY_FULL)

    User->>API: POST /api/race/ready (Ready button click)
    API-->>User: room state with ready flags

    Note over User: Both ready → READY_CHECK

    User->>API: POST /api/race/multiplayer-start
    API-->>User: targetStartMs, serverNowMs
    User->>Store: setGameState(COUNTDOWN, targetStartMs)

    Note over LobbyPoll: Stops polling (race starting)

    Note over SyncPoll: Starts polling at 500ms

    SyncPoll->>API: POST /api/race/sync (progress, wpm)
    API-->>SyncPoll: opponentProgress, state, winnerId

    Note over SyncPoll: state === FINISHED

    SyncPoll->>Store: setGameState(FINISHED, winnerId)
    User->>API: POST /api/race/multiplayer/save
    API-->>User: SAVED / ALREADY_SAVED
    User->>Store: persistenceStatus = SAVED
```

---

