```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── lobby/
│   │   └── page.tsx                    ← [NEW] Lobby entry page
│   └── race/
│       └── [roomId]/
│           └── page.tsx                ← [MODIFY] Wire ready/start/save
├── components/
│   ├── game/
│   │   ├── TypeInput.tsx               ← No changes needed
│   │   ├── GhostCar.tsx                ← No changes needed
│   │   ├── PlayerCar.tsx               ← No changes needed
│   │   └── ReadyUpOverlay.tsx          ← [NEW] Ready-up UI
│   └── ResultsModal.tsx                ← [MODIFY] Winner/Loser + persistence feedback
├── hooks/
│   ├── useRaceSync.ts                  ← [MODIFY] Stop on finish, trigger save
│   └── useLobbyPolling.ts             ← [NEW] Lobby-phase polling
├── services/
│   ├── raceApi.ts                      ← No changes needed (solo)
│   └── multiplayerApi.ts              ← [NEW] All multiplayer API calls
└── store/
    └── useRaceStore.ts                 ← [MODIFY] Add role, ready flags, persistence status
```

**Summary:** 1 new page, 1 new service, 1 new hook, 1 new component, and 4 modifications to existing files.
